  :adr/body
  "# Decision\n\n`abaki` is canonical in its independent flat-path repository. Seed, generated route-around policy, and analysis are single-form EDN. JSON metadata/output and the standalone Markdown report are retired.\n\nThe two runtime consumers discovered during extraction are explicitly rewired. `okaimono` and `fuchi` read `routing-policy.edn` through `ABAKI_POLICY_PATH` or their documented flat-west sibling path. Missing policy remains fail-open as before; malformed data does not create a secret blocklist. `fuchi` PR #3 carries the independent-repository wiring. Root aggregate tests no longer load abaki namespaces; standalone repository CI owns those tests."}]
